# gale

--- Blower_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_BLOWER_1_DESC
raw  Gale's Super now stuns enemies for <VALUE1> seconds if they are pushed against obstacles.
now  Gale's Super now stuns enemies for 25 seconds if they are pushed against obstacles.
